## Model card

- **Name:** GPT-5.1 Codex Mini
- **Short description:** OpenAI's smaller, more cost-effective, less-capable variant of GPT-5.1-Codex positioned for high-volume coding and agentic workloads. Status reported as shut down in current OpenAI documentation.
- **Provider / access:** OpenAI API `gpt-5.1-codex-mini`. Responses API supported; Chat Completions not supported per platform docs. Available via OpenRouter `openai/gpt-5.1-codex-mini` Chat Completions proxy.
- **Release / knowledge:** Conflict in sources. OpenAI model docs list knowledge cutoff Sep 30, 2024 and status Shut down, with no explicit release date shown. LLM Stats tracks release 2025-11-12. No verified official release announcement found in searches.
- **IDs:** `openai/gpt-5.1-codex-mini`
- **Context window:** 400,000 tokens total; 128,000 max output tokens. Verified by OpenAI platform docs and LLM Stats pricing table.
- **Modalities:** Input text, image; Output text. Reasoning token support yes. Function calling and web_search supported on Responses API. Structured outputs supported per docs.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-25):** $0.25 / 1M input, $0.025 / 1M cached input, $2.00 / 1M output via OpenAI. LLM Stats confirms $0.25 in / $2.00 out.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary. Parameters undisclosed.

